 "description": "Pending Replies: mark a reply done once the user replied (outcome sent, default) or decided not to (dismissed). Dayze sends nothing; this only records it. By reply_id, or person_name / person_id when that person has exactly one unsent reply (otherwise the candidates come back and nothing changes). Reopen with update_pending_reply status pending. Requires API key or OAuth with context.write. ($0.05; API key required)",
 "destructiveHint": false,
